.TH tapectl-collection-sync 1  "tapectl-collection-sync " 
.SH NAME
tapectl\-collection\-sync \- Sync every configured collection: register new unit folders, resolve moved/renamed ones by dotfile uuid, mark vanished ones `missing` (never deleted or retired — those are operator acts)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtapectl collection sync\fR [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sync every configured collection: register new unit folders, resolve moved/renamed ones by dotfile uuid, mark vanished ones `missing` (never deleted or retired — those are operator acts)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Report what would change without mutating anything
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output in JSON format
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Enable verbose output
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Skip confirmation prompts
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to config file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
